    "body": "Problem:\n`CTRL-]` via `vim.lsp.tagfunc` passes URI paths through `:tag`, which expands `$VAR`. Files such as `people_.$personId.tsx` then fail with E429.\n\nSolution:\n`fnameescape()` the filename in tag items so `$` is treated as literal.\n\nFixes #41313",
